==Battleground==
*1 [[Zoge]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 4~5.33 seconds<sup>120f~160f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 4~5.33 seconds<sup>120f~160f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**8 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There is no boss shockwave, so the level can be easily rushed with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]].

